{
  "_note": "一个服务的事故历史(首页「近 7 天」、详情页「近 30 天 / 近期事故」共用),原样交给页面 JS 解析,JS 层按服务缓存 1 小时(存的是近 35 天的精简列表)。\n近期事故数据源(2026-09-25 实测后选定,v2):\n· Statuspage 原生(sp):`/history.json` —— 本季度逐月的全部事故,**带 impact 与开始时刻**,7–114KB(未压缩;线上走 gzip 约 3–27KB)。没有更轻的端点:`incidents.json` 全量 140–290KB、`?limit=` / `?per_page=` 均被忽略;`history.rss` 30–77KB 且**没有 impact**(按当日最重影响着色做不到)。\n  ⚠️ 它只覆盖**当前季度**(start_time = 季初):窗口跨进上一季度时另取 `?page=2`。\n  ⚠️ timestamp 是展示串「Sep <var…>24</var>, <var…>16:51</var> - … UTC」,时区按页面(EDT / PDT 也有),偏移从 start_time 取;**月份取 timestamp 开头的缩写**(跨月事故挂在结束月的块下),年取月块。\n· incident.io 兼容层(io):`incidents.json` 最新 25 条(29–41KB),created_at 是 ISO 串,impact 同名。\n· 计划维护(impact = maintenance)不算事故;impact = none 的公告按「轻微异常」计(与页面同一判据)。",
  "_lintCache": "exempt",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "idIn",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${id},)]"
      },
      "_note": "入参落地(勿删)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "p2In",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${p2},0)]"
      },
      "_note": "页面按日期算好:近 30 天的窗口跨进上一季度时传 1(history.json 只覆盖当前季度)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${idIn},github),1,0)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "h",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://www.githubstatus.com/history.json",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "header": {
              "Accept": "application/json"
            },
            "timeout": "8000"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "u",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://www.githubstatus.com/api/v2/scheduled-maintenances/upcoming.json",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "header": {
              "Accept": "application/json"
            },
            "timeout": "8000"
          },
          "_note": "即将进行的计划维护(平时 ~170B)。incident.io 那几家没有这个端点(404)。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${idIn},github),eq::(${p2In},1)),1,0)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "g",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://www.githubstatus.com/history.json?page=2",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "header": {
              "Accept": "application/json"
            },
            "timeout": "8000"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
